The CHGame adaptation replaces Arduboy hardware services, EEPROM and AVR
pointer handling, adds native pause/mute controls, expands the scrolling
viewport to 128x128, adds selectable color palettes and a continuous splash
illustration derived from the original title artwork,
and corrects fixed-width arithmetic and the all-coins badge total. Original
sprite shapes, 39-level order, physics, enemies and scoring are retained.

Version 1.3.0 adds the title, five gameplay scores and fourteen sound effects
from the MIT-licensed ATMlib edition by T-arg / TEAM a.r.g.:
https://github.com/T-arg/ID-34-Mystic-Balloon
Commit: 87354104ee5b027e1e4b1c755de1b1be76e091b9
Only its audio is imported; the original 39 levels above remain intact.

